OL,3,GNEWSATeens who died in car that entered
OL,4,Ariver named
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys and a teenage girl who
OL,7,Fdied when the car they were in ended up
OL,8,Fin the River Wear have been named by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FJackson Duke, 17, Luke Etheridge and
OL,12,FZara Shaw, both 16, were in a black
OL,13,FAudi A3 that came off the road at Panns
OL,14,FBank near Wearmouth Bridge, Sunderland,
OL,15,Fand plunged into the water just before
OL,16,F13:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,18,FJackson and Luke were from Sunderland
OL,19,Fand Zara was from Houghton-le-Spring, a
OL,20,Ftown about seven miles (11km) from the
OL,21,Fcity. All were students at Sunderland
OL,22,FCollege.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
