OL,4,Ariver named
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police said there were four
OL,7,Fpeople inside the car at the time and a
OL,8,F17-year-old boy, who managed to reach
OL,9,Fsafety, had been arrested on suspicion
OL,10,Fof causing death by dangerous driving.
